Deals True damage to all enemies in Avalanche Area and pushes them <@ba.vup>tremendously</>;
deals True damage to all allied units in Avalanche Area and pushes them by <@ba.vup>one tile</>, if they <@ba.vup>cannot be pushed</>, deals more True damage and inflicts Stun; 
<@ba.rem>Operators are pushed in the Saintess Statue's pointing direction</>
